{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-001", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "个人信息保护法规定，处理个人信息应当遵循哪些基本原则？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》的规定，处理个人信息应当遵循以下基本原则：\n\n1. **合法、正当、必要和诚信原则**（第五条）：不得通过误导、欺诈、胁迫等方式处理个人信息。\n2. **目的明确、合理原则**（第六条）：处理个人信息应当具有明确、合理的目的，并应当与处理目的直接相关，采取对个人权益影响最小的方式。\n3. **公开、透明原则**（第七条）：公开个人信息处理规则，明示处理的目的、方式和范围。\n4. **保证个人信息质量原则**（第八条）：避免因个人信息不准确、不完整对个人权益造成不利影响。\n5. **不得危害国家安全、公共利益原则**：不得从事危害国家安全、公共利益的个人信息处理活动。", "latency_ms": 4182, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第五条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-002", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "个人信息保护法对收集个人信息的范围有什么限制？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》，对收集个人信息的范围主要有以下限制：\n\n1. **最小必要原则**：收集个人信息应当限于实现处理目的的最小范围，不得过度收集个人信息。\n2. **目的限定**：所收集的个人图像、身份识别信息只能用于维护公共安全的目的，不得用于其他目的。\n3. **禁止非法收集**：任何组织、个人不得非法收集、使用、加工、传输他人个人信息。\n4. **禁止危害国家安全和公共利益**：不得从事危害国家安全、公共利益的个人信息处理活动。\n5. **提供限制**：未经被收集者同意，不得向他人提供个人信息。\n6. **例外情形**：处理个人信息属于提供产品或者服务所必需的除外。", "latency_ms": 2753, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第六条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "dsl-001", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "数据安全法要求数据处理者建立什么制度来保障数据安全？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》的要求，数据处理者应当建立健全**全流程数据安全管理制度**，并组织开展数据安全教育培训，采取相应的技术措施和其他必要措施，保障数据安全。", "latency_ms": 1823, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 dsl:第二十七条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：建立健全全流程数据安全管理制度"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "dsl-002", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "数据安全法规定，发现数据安全缺陷、漏洞等风险时应当怎么做？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》第二十九条，开展数据处理活动应当加强风险监测，发现数据安全缺陷、漏洞等风险时，**应当立即采取补救措施**；如果发现其网络产品、服务存在安全缺陷、漏洞等风险，还应当**按照规定及时告知用户并向有关主管部门报告**。", "latency_ms": 2436, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 dsl:第二十九条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "csl-001", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "网络安全法规定国家实行什么制度来保护网络安全？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国网络安全法》第二十一条规定，国家实行**网络安全等级保护制度**来保护网络安全。", "latency_ms": 2242, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第二十一条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：国家实行网络安全等级保护制度"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "csl-002", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "网络安全法要求网络日志至少留存多长时间？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》的规定，网络日志至少留存**六个月**。", "latency_ms": 2347, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第二十一条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：留存相关的网络日志不少于六个月"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-003", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法第13条规定，个人信息处理者在哪些情形下才可以处理个人信息？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第13条，个人信息处理者只有在符合下列情形之一时，方可处理个人信息：\n\n1. **取得个人的同意**；\n2. 为订立、履行个人作为一方当事人的合同所必需，或者按照依法制定的劳动规章制度和依法签订的集体合同实施人力资源管理所必需；\n3. 为履行法定职责或者法定义务所必需；\n4. 为应对突发公共卫生事件，或者紧急情况下为保护自然人的生命健康和财产安全所必需；\n5. 为公共利益实施新闻报道、舆论监督等行为，在合理的范围内处理个人信息；\n6. 依照本法规定在合理的范围内处理个人自行公开或者其他已经合法公开的个人信息；\n7. 法律、行政法规规定的其他情形。\n\n此外，第13条还规定，处理个人信息属于提供产品或者服务所必需的除外；处理敏感个人信息，只有在具有特定的目的和充分的必要性，并采取严格保护措施的情形下，个人信息处理者方可处理。", "latency_ms": 2380, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第十三条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-004", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法如何界定敏感个人信息，处理它需要满足什么条件？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》的规定，敏感个人信息的界定和处理条件如下：\n\n**一、敏感个人信息的界定**\n\n敏感个人信息是一旦泄露或者非法使用，容易导致自然人的人格尊严受到侵害或者人身、财产安全受到危害的个人信息。具体包括：\n- 生物识别信息\n- 宗教信仰\n- 特定身份\n- 医疗健康\n- 金融账户\n- 行踪轨迹等信息\n- 不满十四周岁未成年人的个人信息\n\n**二、处理敏感个人信息需要满足的条件**\n\n1. **特定目的和充分必要性**：只有在具有特定的目的和充分的必要性，并采取严格保护措施的情形下，方可处理敏感个人信息。\n\n2. **取得单独同意**：处理敏感个人信息应当取得个人的单独同意；法律、行政法规规定应当取得书面同意的，从其规定。\n\n3. **告知义务**：除一般告知事项外，还应当向个人告知处理敏感个人信息的必要性以及对个人权益的影响。\n\n4. **事前影响评估**：应当事前进行个人信息保护影响评估，并对处理情况进行记录。\n\n5. **遵守特别规定**：法律、行政法规对处理敏感个人信息规定应当取得相关行政许可或者作出其他限制的，从其规定。\n\n6. **不得危害国家安全和公共利益**：不得从事危害国家安全、公共利益的个人信息处理活动。", "latency_ms": 2453, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第二十八条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 3/3"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "dsl-003", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "数据安全法对重要数据的处理者规定了哪些额外的安全义务？", "answer": "根据上下文，数据安全法对重要数据的处理者规定的额外安全义务主要包括：\n\n1. **明确数据安全负责人和管理机构，落实数据安全保护责任**。\n2. **按照规定对其数据处理活动定期开展风险评估，并向有关主管部门报送风险评估报告**（第三十条）。", "latency_ms": 2196, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 dsl:第二十七条, dsl:第三十条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "csl-003", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "网络安全法对关键信息基础设施运营者收集产生的个人信息和重要数据有什么存储要求？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》第三十七条和第四十条的规定，关键信息基础设施运营者在中华人民共和国境内运营中收集和产生的**个人信息和重要数据，应当在境内存储**。", "latency_ms": 2204, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第三十七条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.5, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 1/2；缺：安全评估"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-005", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "个人信息保护法规定，哪些情形下处理个人信息应当事前进行个人信息保护影响评估？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第五十五条的规定，个人信息处理者应当事前进行个人信息保护影响评估的情形包括：\n\n1. **处理敏感个人信息**；\n2. **其他对个人权益有重大影响的个人信息处理活动**（第五十五条第五项）。\n\n此外，结合第五十六条及相关内容，处理已公开的个人信息，若对个人权益有重大影响的，也应当依照本法规定取得个人同意，但该条并未直接列为事前评估的独立情形。", "latency_ms": 4804, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第五十五条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.5, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 1/2；缺：向境外提供个人信息"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "csl-004", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "网络安全法规定网络运营者收集、使用个人信息应当遵循什么原则？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》第四十一条的规定，网络运营者收集、使用个人信息，应当遵循**合法、正当、必要**的原则。", "latency_ms": 1866, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第四十一条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/2；缺：合法、正当、必要的原则、经被收集者同意"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-006", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "个人信息保护法规定，哪些情形下处理个人信息不需要取得个人同意？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第十三条的规定，处理个人信息应当取得个人同意，但在以下情形下**不需要取得个人同意**：\n\n1. **为订立、履行个人作为一方当事人的合同所必需**，或者按照依法制定的劳动规章制度和依法签订的集体合同实施人力资源管理所必需；\n2. **为履行法定职责或者法定义务所必需**；\n3. **为应对突发公共卫生事件**，或者紧急情况下为保护自然人的生命健康和财产安全所必需；\n4. **为公共利益实施新闻报道、舆论监督等行为**，在合理的范围内处理个人信息；\n5. **依照本法规定在合理的范围内处理个人自行公开或者其他已经合法公开的个人信息**；\n6. **法律、行政法规规定的其他情形**。\n\n此外，根据该法第七十二条，**自然人因个人或者家庭事务处理个人信息的，不适用本法**，因此也不涉及取得个人同意的问题。\n\n需要注意的是，即使属于上述无需取得同意的情形，处理个人信息仍应遵循合法、正当、必要和诚信原则，不得从事危害国家安全、公共利益的个人信息处理活动。", "latency_ms": 3446, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第十三条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "csl-005", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "网络安全法规定，网络运营者向他人提供个人信息在什么情况下可以不经被收集者同意？", "answer": "根据你提供的上下文，**网络安全法并没有规定网络运营者向他人提供个人信息可以不经被收集者同意的情形**。  \n\n上下文明确写明：**“未经被收集者同意，不得向他人提供个人信息。”** 因此，按照该内容，向他人提供个人信息原则上必须经被收集者同意，不能不经同意提供。", "latency_ms": 2261, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第四十二条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：经过处理无法识别特定个人且不能复原的除外"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "pipl-007", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法对处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息有什么特别要求？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》，处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息有以下特别要求：\n\n1. **取得监护人同意**：个人信息处理者处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息的，应当取得未成年人的父母或者其他监护人的同意（第三十一条）。\n\n2. **制定专门处理规则**：个人信息处理者处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息的，应当制定专门的个人信息处理规则（第三十一条）。\n\n3. **视为敏感个人信息**：不满十四周岁未成年人的个人信息属于敏感个人信息（第二十八条）。敏感个人信息是一旦泄露或者非法使用，容易导致自然人的人格尊严受到侵害或者人身、财产安全受到危害的个人信息。因此，处理此类信息还需遵守敏感个人信息的处理规则。", "latency_ms": 2236, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第三十一条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "csl-006", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "关键信息基础设施运营者确需向境外提供个人信息和重要数据时，需要履行什么程序？", "answer": "根据提供的上下文，关键信息基础设施运营者确需向境外提供个人信息和重要数据时，需要履行的程序是：**通过国家网信部门组织的安全评估**。\n\n具体依据如下：\n\n1. **第四十条**明确规定：关键信息基础设施运营者和处理个人信息达到国家网信部门规定数量的个人信息处理者，应当将在中华人民共和国境内收集和产生的个人信息存储在境内。**确需向境外提供的，应当通过国家网信部门组织的安全评估**。\n\n2. **第三十八条**（四）也规定：向境外提供个人信息的，应当具备的条件之一是“依照本法第四十条的规定通过国家网信部门组织的安全评估”。\n\n因此，关键信息基础设施运营者确需向境外提供个人信息和重要数据时，必须履行**国家网信部门组织的安全评估**程序。", "latency_ms": 2549, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第三十七条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：按照国家网信部门会同国务院有关部门制定的办法进行安全评估"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "dsl-004", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "数据安全法规定，哪类数据需要实行比一般数据更严格的管理制度？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》规定，**关系国家安全、国民经济命脉、重要民生、重大公共利益等数据属于国家核心数据，实行比一般数据更加严格的管理制度**。", "latency_ms": 2391, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 dsl:第二十一条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.5, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 1/2；缺：实行更加严格的管理制度"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
