{"run_id": "20260921T140342Z-0431b4", "case_id": "refuse-003", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "欧盟通用数据保护条例（GDPR）对违规企业的罚款上限是多少？", "answer": "根据你提供的上下文，**并没有提到欧盟《通用数据保护条例》（GDPR）**，其中规定的是中国相关数据安全与个人信息保护法律中的罚款上限。\n\n不过，如果直接回答你关于 **GDPR** 的问题：\n\n**GDPR 对违规企业的罚款上限分为两档：**\n\n1. **最高 1000 万欧元，或企业上一财政年度全球总营业额的 2%**，以较高者为准；\n2. **最高 2000 万欧元，或企业上一财政年度全球总营业额的 4%**，以较高者为准。\n\n其中，第二档适用于更严重的违法行为，例如违反数据处理基本原则、用户同意条件、数据主体权利等核心义务。\n\n所以，**GDPR 的罚款上限是 2000 万欧元或全球年营业额 4%，取较高者**。", "latency_ms": 2870, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "本应拒答却给出了答案（幻觉风险）"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
